Package: monolixPipelineR
Title: Multi-Start Fitting, Covariate Building and Model Comparison for Monolix
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Maddie", "Gastonguay", email = "gastonguay.madeleine@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions and a driver script for fitting nonlinear mixed effects
    models in Monolix through lixoftConnectors: two-phase initial guess sampling
    to check identifiability, repeated sampling with fixed parameters, stepwise
    covariate model building, and paired comparison of candidate treatment-effect
    models. Works with any long-format dataset and Mlxtran structural model.
